            "quote": "such work returns control without failure classification, keeping the same edge and a replay-visible resume basis",
            "section": "urn:a-c:project:8ae07eeca101a93be143e873f9d12ab43e316ef0359058c0c9fa71380880d2d5/source/build_tenants/a_c/representation/stdo-v3.0.5-rc.1/source/standards/ODD.md#ODD%2F1.%20Position%2FFoundation%20to%20law",
            "start_line": 128
          }
        ],
        "statement": "Each action binds current gap to exact target assets/obligations before invocation; only published lawful actions are ranked. The selected outcome bounds the loop. After a terminal condition, no further material work is selected without another admitted basis. Reprice requests constitutional re-entry and selects nothing. Lawful but undecided work yields control without failure classification, preserving the same edge and replay-visible resume basis; yield differs from retry, block and timeout. Edge closure is evidence toward Product acceptance, not acceptance.",
